{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"135262","name":"The Park","description":"Enjoy stunning views from the terrace and garden of this Piraeus hotel, and stay connected with complimentary Wi-Fi. Amenities include babysitting services (surcharge), wedding services, and a common area television. The Park restaurant offers delicious international cuisine for lunch and dinner, and room service is available during limited hours. Unwind with a drink at the bar/lounge. Continental breakfast is available daily (fee applies). The hotel also features limo/town car service, dry cleaning/laundry services, and a 24-hour front desk. For events, the hotel offers 2, 260 square feet (210 square meters) of conference and meeting space. Self-parking is available onsite (subject to charges). Each of the 80 guestrooms provides a refrigerator, private balcony, complimentary Wi-Fi, and a private bathroom with a bathtub or shower, complimentary toiletries, and a hair dryer. The hotel is conveniently located near the Municipal Theatre of Piraeus, the Port of Piraeus, and other attractions.","address":"Kolokotroni, 103","city":"PIRAEUS","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"18535","lat":37.94009272669982,"lng":23.643403320237667,"stars":3,"giataCode":"71103","phone":"2104524611","email":"info@thepark.gr","website":"www.thepark.gr","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/13/135262/135262a_hb_a_024.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/13/135262/135262a_hb_a_025.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/13/135262/135262a_hb_a_003.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/13/135262/135262a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/13/135262/135262a_hb_a_005.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/13/135262/135262a_hb_a_006.jpg","cate